{
  "id": "2KI.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Sugoodiga 4",
  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha ghaweat masinung'weanda bwarbwar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweesa Elisha gatmooda was masinung'weanda bea sibaneanagi aba jeeda sibanga. Ak gwayeesha, “Siida mureeda, siyeedeanyu nimi ak ginali gideaba siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ea doabiiwaat aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ak ea nihidu siida siileeda, ak ghamneawa ea nihidu gagasa gageanda orjoogeasu asiyeenya ghoah soomjooga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Ak ghamneawa gaydahiindaneeyiin? Gindeawi naaha aba jeedeaba gheang'u?” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Aniini hudaang'u bea gadiyeeda meandeawani gil aba ghoah geaghus gideeshteayda nagheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Una giischeewda ak ginung' eegu dabita manda jeeda gil, nea adiing'ayiidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang'ata guwi gah sea orjoagaagu ak giradi gidaghuuta, ak giyiini nagheeda jeedeaba dabitida seaniin ama gea nyiit abeeda gisaji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa gatmooda jeedeaba gheanyi sea orjoagaaschi. Ak ghwarat gidaghuuta, ak geeyeassa dabita ak gwayamsa nagheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ninyiit dabitida nagheega, hean ghwalamda gatmooda ak gwayeesha orjeedaanyi, “Eani gicha dabicheanda.” Gwayeesha, “Mudu gwanda gicha suuk.” Hean ghang'at nagheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikta heeda siidida bea ASEETEAN ak gwarukusa. Ak gwayeesha, “Una ak gishaaydi nagheani ak giiruuti siileadaang'u ama lapiyeeda lagaan abeeda gigadiyeati sea orjoagaagu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha ea gatmooda was meanang'ocheanda leabu Shunemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi eaweecha Elisha gawa ng'eanyiida Shunemu. Abeeda gwanda gatmooni was meanang'oocheanda mida gheanyi hoowa, inyeesa gaguursa Elisha ghwahidu agiischooda. Ak inyeesa iiwea Elisha ak gwasik naweedida gawa gweagiischi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda gatmoodida ak gwayeesha siyeadaanyi. “Aniini neajeeng'u gideaba siisi gootu ghaheanyean siida ghaydit bea ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaniyean eesisiina ghooriini mwanang' aba uhuuda gheeda. Ak geedeeksi bulaliida, nea geayiinyi jeeda measa, ea hoorgeeda ea gheaboong'nyeanda, aba gideaba iihidu gawa jeeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha ghwahidu Elisha hoowa, ak gawa jeedeaba ghooriidida gafuuf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Elisha siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda siguura Gehasi. “Guursiina gatmoodida bea ng'eanyiida Shunamuun.” Iidu nea geeguursa hean ghwahidu ak ghamiinaada aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha Gehasi, “Anyaasha gatmooda gideaba ng'ula ang'iing'i ghamneawa gidaniweataneasa gajeesimaneey naaha? Gwanda ng'asheanda igasayi eerukusiina sugoocheanda ghana shirikarajeanda haw?” Ghwalamda gatmoodida ak gwayeesha. “Aniini geabiidi jeeda fugeasu nea geabwaageaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Gajeesimana naaha?” Ghwasha Gehasi ak gwayeesha, “Aba huumwa mandeawana baleanda, ak gabada nih siyeadaanyi niwaasiit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Una guursiina.” Iidu nea geeguursa, ghwahidu ak ghamiinaada aba gidaghuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Gweanyi hiduuni damanda uurji nih abeeda gaymideawana baleanda.” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Manda, siideanyu haw, Ea orjeeda siida ASEETA adireenganayi hudaang'u bea gadiyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gagweayiit gatmoodida ak gwaji baleanda, aba damanda ghayi rukuta Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea nihissa heeda jeeptida, eaweecha goodeayi ghwaan ghwalach booga sea fih suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha baleanda ghwaan, “Bwaabwa ghwaak uhuudeanyu gayghabwaran uhuuda!” Ghwalamda ghwaan ak gwayeesha siida gadiyeeda, “Sareana aada heeda ghaamwat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasar ghoadealda heeda ghaamwat, ak gookar ghaamwat ea ghabwarbwara aseeta ak ghoabita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwadiyeada ghaamwat ak ghwayiin badayda bulaliideaba siidida bea ASEETEAN, ak ghwarat gidaghuuta ak gwarita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguursa siyeadaanyi nea gwayeesha, “Nung' ghwahidu siyagi bea gadiyeeda nea gweadu digeeda. Aba gideaba gaydafwach dawa heeda siidida bea ASEETEAN nea ghaalamwaji ak geabiigu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda siyeadaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda gayweesiina ghamneawa? Nea mii ng'ushiinda sheeda gil, ak ea mii sabaato gil.” Gwayeesha, “Mii gil gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasat digeeda gawa nea gwayeesha siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, “Nung' gawa digeeda nea ghwalamwach ada gafuuf geaghus dargu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa ea ghwahita heeda siidida bea ASEETEAN, nea abeeda gwanda Giijeeda Garmeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ang'wearda siida ASEETA ak ghwadaah gatmooda nea ghwahidu, ghwalamda ak gwayeesha Gehasi was siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, “Ng'ula gatmooda ng'eanyiida Shunemu diita ghwahidu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "una roonyeeda ak giyeeshi, Gibea seayu? Siyeadaang'u gaba seayu? Jeepta gaba seayu?” Ak gwayi, “Gaba seayu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahita hoowa bea giijeeda mida siida ASEETEAN, ghoang'waay geeshanga. Ak gawa Gehasi ghoang'aamwa hoowa, ghwalamda siidida bea ASEETEAN ak gwayeesha, “Nung'waada aba gideaba gwasawana gurooroadaanyi muuchi aba jih; ak ea nifunyanaan NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheanji moahiimnaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda gatmoodida ak gwayeesha, “Siideanyu bea mureeda ghayi mwoamu seey baleanda? Ak ea meayeeshiineey adireenganean?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha Gehasi, “Radiischeena ak giing'waanyi bileangideanyu ak guwi, nea iroonyeewi sih adiigeacheewi nea iyageacheewaneey sih gisiindi. Ak guwi iina bileangideanyu gheamamda baleanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda gheamata baleanda ak gwayeesha Elisha, “Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA ea gidabiideata gurooroadaang'u, maydanung'useey heeda.” Hean ghang'eat ak goodeayi gatmooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goosheeda Gehasi gawa ea mwahita ghwayiin bileangida gheamamda baleanda, ak ea mwanya ghuuta gwayi saw. Hean gabiigu gwaroonyi Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Jeepta mwang'eada.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean hita Elisha jeeda gheeda, ghwadaah baleanda niibita nea gwanda badayda bulaliidaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa gah ak gwarasa geaw gidaghuuta geaghus niny sea jeeptida, ak ghamwaash NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwading'da badayda bulaliida ak gawiil geaw aba badayda baleanda. Ak ghwayiin uhuudaanyi uhuuda baleanda nea ghwayiin gheanyangaaschi gheanyanga baleanda, ea geatingaaschi ghwayiin geatinga baleanda. Ak goowiida aba badaydaanyi hean ghwashang'shang'iit saseeda baleanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Elisha ak gwaneay aba jeedeaba gheedida. Ak gabiikta goowiida geaw aba badaydeaba jeeptida, hean gootirshean baleanda niba ispwa. Ak ghwajaada gheanyangaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguursa Elisha Gehasi ak gwayeesha, “Guursiina gatmoodida bea Shunamuun.” Hean gaguursa; iidu nea ghwahita heeda mida Elisha gwayeesha, “Nukwa orjeedang'u aada.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobeedeaysa madeeda Elisha, ak gwatkuy ea ghang'uda gheamamdaanyi ng'eanyi. Ak ghang'eat gageanda orjeedaanyi ak gawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asha suuk iyeenya deamdeameadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiikta Elisha ng'eanyiida Gilgali abeeda gwanda ng'eanyiida geejeeda. Nea abeeda sibanga ghabwatgeat gwanda madeadaanyi, ak ghwalamda ak gwayeesha siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, “Iina dahuuda haw beasta, ak giiwooscheesi sibang'su.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa siyagi aba jeenyaawa jeeda madamnyeanda gabit nyeanyiida. Ak ghwadaah sabiibooda dareabeeta ak gabit ea ghwanyiit hang'daanyi ak gweadu ak gwalakiisa jeeda dahuuda aba gideaba mwanala geeta was. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwalealsa ghwaak; hean nea gweagiischi geechuur nea geeyi, Ea orjeeda siida ASEETA hamidi gayghabwar siida!” Ak geanung'waada agiischooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Ayeani dearanga.” Ak gwajaksa jeeda dahuuda, amang'ata gwayeesha, “Lealsiina buuneeda gweagiischi.” Hean geeyeagiischi nea manda siida ajuur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu sih nea gwaleabu ng'eanyiida Baal-shalisha, nea gweasa siida ASEETA mukaataji diktam sisna booga madeeda siguura shayiiri, ea muschoonga shabeadi bea ngaano nea siinyiit guniyajeega. Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Adawa buuneeda ghwaak.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda ak gwayeesha, “Suh gaygwadeayi aba fiisu as bughalaan?” Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Adawa ghwaak, aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Suh gayghwaak ea ghwalach.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayiin madeanyaawa. Ak ghwaak ea ghwalagaan suung'ay gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
